/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E (Experienced improvisers internalize all these options; But when you are learning to improvise it can become extremely hard to process so much information, and as a result your solos may sound truncated, disconnected, boxed, or overly "theoretical". )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
